  "deterministic_setup": [],
  "agent_guidance": "For this version, change the generated build.gradle test dependency from `testImplementation \"org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial:$libraryVersion\"` to `testImplementation \"org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-spatial:$libraryVersion\"`. Do not add the org.hibernate.orm coordinate alongside the old org.hibernate one — keeping both present still fails resolution, since org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial is a Gradle-metadata relocation whose target reimports a platform BOM that redeclares both coordinates, producing a version-constraint cycle. Existing test code (SpatialInitializer, StandardServiceRegistryBuilder) is unchanged in the relocated artifact and needs no source changes.",
